  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The European Tropical Forest Advisers Group, ETFAG, &#xE4;r en informell sammanslutning av skogsexperter fr&#xE5;n Europeiska Kommissionen och medlemstaternas bist&#xE5;ndsorganisationer. Syftet med ETFAG &#xE4;r att &#xF6;ka kunskapsutbyte, synergier och harmonisering mellan givarna p&#xE5; det skogliga omr&#xE5;det. Temat f&#xF6;r &#xE5;rets m&#xF6;te f&#xF6;resl&#xE5;s bli: &quot;Building capacity for forest governance&quot;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The European Tropical Forestry Advisers Group, ETFAG, is an informal group of tropical forestry experts from the European Commission and the member states.The meetings are hosted on a rotational basis by one of the Member States or by the Commission. For 2010, Sida has agreed to be the host.</narrative>
  </description>
